WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.250
Who really builds a building?

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:04.350
Not just the crew with the hammers.

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:06.100
It starts with one owner,

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:07.400
one empty plot,

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:09.200
and one big idea.

00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:12.500
Most people think design is just pretty drawings.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:14.600
But every line has a price:

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:15.980
the designer draws it,

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:18.400
and the QS counts its cost.
